{"kelime":"إخرائيل","sozlukler":{"kaikki_vikisozluk":[{"w":"إخرائيل","u":"إخرائيل","p":"name","h":"ar-proper noun","e":"إِخْرَائِيل • (ʔiḵrāʔīl) f","t":"Blend of إِسْرَائِيل (ʔisrāʔīl, “Israel”) + خِرَاء (ḵirāʔ, “shit”). Compare English blends Pissrael, Shitrael, Israhell, Isn'treal.","synonyms":["الكِيَان الصِّهْيُونِيّ","أَيْرَائِيل"],"g":["Israel, the Zionist entity"],"tag":["colloquial","derogatory","vulgar"],"r":["ʔiḵrāʔīl"],"ipa":["/ʔix.raː.ʔiːl/"],"el":[["إِسْرَائِيل","إسرائيل#Arabic"],["خِرَاء","خراء#Arabic"],["Pissrael","Pissrael#English"],["Shitrael","Shitrael#English"],["Israhell","Israhell#English"],["Isn'treal","Isn'treal#English"]],"yol":""}]}}